  "Description": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Stiff leather wraps around the waist, reinforced with iron studs and worn smooth by years of travel. It carries the faint scent of horsehair and old saddle-oil, cinching tight against the rider's frame."
